    }
  },
  "QMiXdTxhbmLM": {
    "proposition_id": "QMiXdTxhbmLM",
    "text": "The dimension of the intersection of subspaces V and W can be determined using the dimension formula for the intersection and sum of subspaces, which is:",
    "source_node": "YZ8M",
    "source_role": "Knowlegable Expert",
    "confidence": 0.5,
    "status": "belief",
    "scope": "pairwise",
    "dependencies": [],
    "evidence": [],
    "metadata": {
      "round": 0
    }
  },
  "2wGdJVVcaRyz": {
    "proposition_id": "2wGdJVVcaRyz",
    "text": "\\[ \\dim(V + W) = \\dim(V) + \\dim(W) - \\dim(V \\cap W) \\]",
    "source_node": "YZ8M",
    "source_role": "Knowlegable Expert",
    "confidence": 0.5,
    "status": "belief",
    "scope": "pairwise",
    "dependencies": [],
    "evidence": [],
    "metadata": {
      "round": 0
    }
  },
  "yKyFezv7y9nN": {
    "proposition_id": "yKyFezv7y9nN",
    "text": "Where \\(V\\) and \\(W\\) are subspaces of a vector space \\(X\\), and \\(V + W\\) is the smallest subspace containing both \\(V\\) and \\(W\\)",
    "source_node": "YZ8M",
    "source_role": "Knowlegable Expert",
    "confidence": 0.5,
    "status": "belief",
    "scope": "pairwise",
    "dependencies": [],
    "evidence": [],
    "metadata": {
      "round": 0
    }
  },
  "mTbPzcJtNbUq": {
    "proposition_id": "mTbPzcJtNbUq",
    "text": "In this case, since \\(V\\) and \\(W\\) are both 4-dimensional and they are subspaces of a 7-dimensional space \\(X\\), the dimension of their sum, \\(V + W\\), must satisfy:",
    "source_node": "YZ8M",
    "source_role": "Knowlegable Expert",
    "confidence": 0.5,
    "status": "belief",
    "scope": "pairwise",
    "dependencies": [],
    "evidence": [],
    "metadata": {
      "round": 0
    }
  },
  "Z7nq3i7A4iqh": {
    "proposition_id": "Z7nq3i7A4iqh",
    "text": "\\[ 4 + 4 - \\dim(V \\cap W) \\leq 7 \\]",
    "source_node": "YZ8M",
    "source_role": "Knowlegable Expert",
    "confidence": 0.5,
    "status": "belief",
    "scope": "pairwise",
    "dependencies": [],
    "evidence": [],
    "metadata": {
